From: CEB-GNRD maintainers <bmc@example.com>
Subject: [PATCH] webui: bound date-time loading and avoid fixed NTP-stop wait

Resolve BMC path once per date/time page session and fetch clock/protocol
in parallel with request timeouts. Preserve cached values during navigation.
Attempt manual time immediately; retry only the explicit NTP setting
conflict for up to 20 seconds. Keep authoritative mode readback and report
real request failures instead of waiting indefinitely.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [CEB-GNRD UI integration]

